Subject: Re: New PRNG / Mersenne-Twister implementation for Renjin
Message-ID: <Dzj1N1iDvcY.wd_VWZiQ6Y0J@renjin-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Dzj1N1iDvcY.h1B1AnGCnHgJ@renjin-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <Dzj1N1iDvcY.a2W1IaXIm50J@renjin-dev.groups.google.com> <Dzj1N1iDvcY.h1B1AnGCnHgJ@renjin-dev.groups.google.com>
